  "body": "The generated markup of the spec of the Document interface looks like:\r\n```html\r\n<dfn data-lt id='document'><c- g>Document</c-></dfn>\r\n```\r\n`data-lt` being empty is supposed to indicate that the empty string is the [appropriate term for this definition](https://tabatkins.github.io/bikeshed/#dfn-contract) which is wrong. Removing `data-lt` should do the trick",
